{"threads":[{"id":"thread_1","facts":[{"id":"fact_1","kind":"want","text":"Find the treasure marked on the party's map.","state":"open","change":"carried","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"high","actionability":"medium","evidence":["prior"]},{"id":"fact_new_1","kind":"could_use","text":"Grimny says the map is the dwarves' hoard map that Bral tried to sell, and that Bral probably hid the hoard at the map's Dragon's Lair, a very small one-room cave the dwarves scouted as a hiding spot.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":["thread_2","thread_16"],"importance":"high","actionability":"high","evidence":["beat_74","beat_75","beat_77"]},{"id":"fact_new_2","kind":"could_use","text":"Dr. Uriah can now read the label under one map location per day; the marked locations read Dragon's lair and Dwarven mine, and the unmarked area proved to be King Hogboon's ruins.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"low","actionability":"medium","evidence":["beat_17","beat_18","beat_20","beat_65"]}]},{"id":"thread_2","facts":[{"id":"fact_2","kind":"want","text":"Kill the dragon near Brandonsford for Eric the Reeve's 1000 gold bounty.","state":"open","change":"carried","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"high","actionability":"high","evidence":["prior"]},{"id":"fact_3","kind":"blocked_by","text":"George says nothing pierces the black dragon's scales